      "text": "  rule nsScan(IS:Ints, S:Int, _:Int, C:Int)\n    => nsScan(intsTail(IS), S, intsHead(IS), 2)\n    requires notBool intsEmpty(IS) andBool C ==Int 1\n     andBool intsHead(IS) >Int S"
